# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=exo
pkgver=4.20.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Xfce's helper library and preferred-programs tool"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://xfce.org/"
license=(GPL-2.0-or-later)
depends=(libxfce4ui)
source=("https://archive.xfce.org/src/xfce/exo/4.20/exo-$pkgver.tar.bz2")
sha256sums=('4277f799245f1efde01cd917fd538ba6b12cf91c9f8a73fe2035fd5456ec078d')

build() {
    cd exo-$pkgver
    # Wayland only, like the rest of Yūrei's GTK
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-debug --disable-x11
    make
}

package() {
    cd exo-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
